		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Especially brutish bull-man with flames flickering about their muzzle. The unholy matrimony of drake and bull.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14 (chainmail), <strong>HP</strong> 34, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 greataxe +6 (1d10) and 1 horns +6 (1d12) or 1 fire breath, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +4, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +2, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Charge</strong>. In place of attacks, move up to double near in a straight line and make 1 horn attack. If hit, x2 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Fire Breath</strong>. Fills a near-sized cube extending from minotaur. DEX 15+ or 1d10 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Fireblood</strong>. Fire immune.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
